{"id":"huntik:page:3511","page_id":3511,"title":"Overshield","kind":"spell","namespace":0,"summary":"Overshield is a spell that creates a shield of indigo energy to protect a Seeker or allies from oncoming attacks.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:S1E16_Overshield_team.png","wikitext":"File:S1E16_Overshield_team.png","links":[]},"aura":{"text":"Indigo","wikitext":"Indigo","links":[]},"class":{"text":"Protective","wikitext":"Protective","links":[]},"users":{"text":"Dante Vale \nMetz","wikitext":"[[Dante Vale]] <br>[[Metz]]","links":[{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Metz","label":"Metz","target_id":"huntik:page:3213","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Metz","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3213"}]},"first":{"text":"\"The Bookshop Hunter\"","wikitext":"\"[[The Bookshop Hunter]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Bookshop Hunter","label":"The Bookshop Hunter","target_id":"huntik:page:4693","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Bookshop_Hunter","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4693"}]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"infobox spell","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:S1E16_Overshield_team.png","value_text":"File:S1E16_Overshield_team.png","links":[]},{"name":"aura","value_wikitext":"Indigo","value_text":"Indigo","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Protective","value_text":"Protective","links":[]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"[[Dante Vale]] <br>[[Metz]]","value_text":"Dante Vale \nMetz","links":[{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Metz","label":"Metz","target_id":"huntik:page:3213","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Metz","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3213"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[The Bookshop Hunter]]\"","value_text":"\"The Bookshop Hunter\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Bookshop Hunter","label":"The Bookshop Hunter","target_id":"huntik:page:4693","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Bookshop_Hunter","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4693"}]}],"start":0,"end":171}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"This spell was used by [[Dante Vale]] to protect himself and his team from [[Klaus]]' flying spiders. [[Lok Lambert]] opened a hole in the barrier so that Dante could invoke [[Ignatius]] through the shield to destroy Klaus' contrivances. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}\n\nDuring the final battle with the [[Blood Spiral]], [[Metz]] used the spell to block incoming [[Nullcurse]] attacks from some [[Casterwill Hunters]] whilst he and [[Lady S.]] helped an injured [[Lucas Casterwill]] and his team. {{source|Dante's Return}}","text":"This spell was used by Dante Vale to protect himself and his team from Klaus' flying spiders. Lok Lambert opened a hole in the barrier so that Dante could invoke Ignatius through the shield to destroy Klaus' contrivances. [The Bookshop Hunter]\n\nDuring the final battle with the Blood Spiral, Metz used the spell to block incoming Nullcurse attacks from some Casterwill Hunters whilst he and Lady S. helped an injured Lucas Casterwill and his team. [Dante's Return]"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall|DUT=Panserbol}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Indigo-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Protective spells]]","text":""}],"full_text":"Overshield is a spell that creates a shield of indigo energy to protect a Seeker or allies from oncoming attacks.\n\n== History ==\nThis spell was used by Dante Vale to protect himself and his team from Klaus' flying spiders. Lok Lambert opened a hole in the barrier so that Dante could invoke Ignatius through the shield to destroy Klaus' contrivances. [The Bookshop Hunter]\n\nDuring the final battle with the Blood Spiral, Metz used the spell to block incoming Nullcurse attacks from some Casterwill Hunters whilst he and Lady S. helped an injured Lucas Casterwill and his team. [Dante's Return]\n\n== International Names ==","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S1E16_Overshield_team.png\n| aura  = Indigo\n| class = Protective\n| users = [[Dante Vale]] <br>[[Metz]]\n| first = \"[[The Bookshop Hunter]]\"\n}}\n'''Overshield''' is a spell that creates a shield of indigo energy to protect a [[Seeker]] or allies from oncoming attacks.\n\n== History ==\nThis spell was used by [[Dante Vale]] to protect himself and his team from [[Klaus]]' flying spiders. [[Lok Lambert]] opened a hole in the barrier so that Dante could invoke [[Ignatius]] through the shield to destroy Klaus' contrivances. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}\n\nDuring the final battle with the [[Blood Spiral]], [[Metz]] used the spell to block incoming [[Nullcurse]] attacks from some [[Casterwill Hunters]] whilst he and [[Lady S.]] helped an injured [[Lucas Casterwill]] and his team. {{source|Dante's Return}}\n\n== International Names ==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall|DUT=Panserbol}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Indigo-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Protective spells]]","categories":["Huntik Foundation magic","Indigo-aura spells","Magic","Protective spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Metz","label":"Metz","target_id":"huntik:page:3213","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Metz","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3213"},{"target_title":"The Bookshop Hunter","label":"The Bookshop Hunter","target_id":"huntik:page:4693","target_url":"https: